{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "包爾庚　諸嗣郢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "曜　胤修"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "姚文然　程芳朝"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "周啟嶲　儲振"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "陳維崧、史惟圓"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "嚴我斯　丁珝"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "弟子德費，備資敬刻\n　方丈和尚語錄第一卷。普願佛日增輝，\n　　　法輪常轉，般若智以現前，菩提心\n　　　而不退。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "弟子德賢，備資敬刻\n　方丈和尚語錄第二卷。所翼四恩總報，\n　　　得生淨土蓮池；三有均資，速至人\n　　　天覺岸。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "時同門遠至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "弟子德　備資敬刻\n　方丈和尚語錄第三卷。端為得戒本師，\n　　　弄駕慈航於碧浪；圓顱耆宿，重開\n　　　慧眼於青霄。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "弟子德璨，備資敬刻\n　方丈和尚語錄第四卷。奉為生身父母，\n　　　頭頭早證真常，過去宗親，處處速\n　　　成勝果。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "甲戌之變，救方玉華等，厚報不受。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "癸丑九月十九日"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "癸丑十一月十三日"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "弟子德　備資敬刻\n　方丈和尚語錄第五卷。伏願匡襄祖道，\n　　　同明般若正因；扶樹宗風，共植金\n　　　剛種智。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "侵損常住\n者，當日敗露而去。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "竊者，是夜投斧殿側。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "弟子　德潤備資敬刻\n　方丈和尚語錄第十卷。惟冀覺了自心，\n　　　超步毘盧寶頂；義成一切，頓圓調\n　　　御十身。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "癸丑十一月十二日"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七十九則"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "弟子寂定、寂盧備資敬刻\n　方丈和尚語錄第十二卷。普願凡為皆\n　　　回向菩提，有作則必獲如意，等攜\n　　　物類，共悟無生。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七十一則"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "弟子照禪、照源、照證、王氏福海刻\n　方丈和尚語錄第十三卷。惟真梯航三\n　　　有，人人慧業昌隆；津濟四生，各各\n　　　智光圓滿。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "君"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "臣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "君視臣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "臣向君"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "君臣道合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "正中偏"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "偏中正"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "正中來"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "兼中至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "兼中到"}
